  trap:"",
  summary:["Hindgut (distal transverse, descending, sigmoid, rectum) → suprapubic","Least splanchnic T12 → inferior mesenteric ganglion","Midgut → superior mesenteric ganglion · Foregut → celiac ganglion"],
