  trap:"",
  summary:["Greater splanchnic T5–9 → foregut → epigastrium","Lesser T10–11 → midgut → periumbilical","Least T12 → hindgut → suprapubic","PUD: epigastrium, gradual, dull/burning, related with meals"],
  mnemonic:"Great–Less–Least = T5–9 / T10–11 / T12",
