  trap:"",
  summary:["Foregut: stomach, proximal duodenum, liver, gallbladder, pancreas → T5–9 → epigastrium","Midgut → T10–11 → periumbilical","Hindgut → T12 → suprapubic"],
  mnemonic:"Great–Less–Least = T5–9 / T10–11 / T12",
